Quest 774 "[Lemegeton] Chasing the Devil"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."

Requires player level >= 75 and quest 773 is completed

Rewards
    Give 1 of 900295000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Ask Bros how we'll be able to seal [Awaken Asmodeus]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Ask Seis how we can seal [Awaken Asmodeus]."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "If we have the [Completed Sealed Scroll] we can do this."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We now have to seal [Devil32]. But Im not sure if he's more powerful now than ever. He could have awaken all the devils to become [Awaken Asmodeus].\n\nIt'll be harder than we've imagined. Since it's my fault I'll try to locate him.\n\nYou need to speak to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "If we have the [Completed Sealed Scroll] we can do this."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We now have to seal [Devil32]. But Im not sure if he's more powerful now than ever. He could have awaken all the devils to become [Awaken Asmodeus].\n\nIt'll be harder than we've imagined. Since it's my fault I'll try to locate him.\n\nYou need to speak to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land."

On claimable
    Show quest "I've located him. He's at Moradon. Go find [Mysterious Mage] and show [Intelligent queen's eyes]."
